WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 43= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:41.120 --> 01:42.799
I have so many reasons to live.

8
01:43.239 --> 01:44.040
What about you?

9
01:44.640 --> 01:45.799
I love eating qingtuan.

10
01:46.239 --> 01:48.560
I also love crystal duck and tofu buns.

11
01:48.959 --> 01:51.079
I love sleeping in with Mother.

12
01:51.519 --> 01:54.519
I love reading and playing with my brother.

13
01:54.760 --> 01:56.920
And I love going to the theater with Aunt Lanxiang.

14
01:57.080 --> 01:59.950
I also love going on spring outings outside the city and flying kites.

15
02:00.000 --> 02:02.290
I love beating a little drum for my third younger brother.

16
02:02.719 --> 02:05.519
I love the pearl hairpin Aunt Suhua gave me.

17
02:07.159 --> 02:09.039
I have so many reasons to live, too.

18
02:09.150 --> 02:10.360
There are too many to name.

19
02:13.520 --> 02:14.759
Yingzhi is right.

20
02:15.039 --> 02:16.800
We have so many reasons to live.

21
02:17.120 --> 02:19.039
We couldn't possibly name them all at once.

22
02:19.192 --> 02:20.280
But one thing is certain.

23
02:21.759 --> 02:23.919
We certainly don't live just to put the jade

24
02:23.919 --> 02:26.000
in Aunt Fengxian's room.

25
02:33.599 --> 02:34.800
I was born a servant,

26
02:35.479 --> 02:36.680
into a poor family.

27
02:37.159 --> 02:38.520
You lost your father and have had

28
02:38.616 --> 02:40.104
to live under someone else's roof.

29
02:40.159 --> 02:41.120
Those are all facts.

30
02:42.000 --> 02:43.560
But no matter what others say,

31
02:43.800 --> 02:44.960
as long as we know

32
02:45.400 --> 02:47.120
what we ourselves live for,

33
02:47.759 --> 02:48.439
all those words

34
02:49.120 --> 02:50.719
are nothing but filth.

35
02:52.560 --> 02:53.639
I understand now.

36
02:53.640 --> 02:56.460
Keep our hearts true, follow the right path, and go far with steady steps.

37
02:56.479 --> 02:58.560
Only then can we be worthy of Mother's love and care,

38
02:58.800 --> 03:00.919
and worthy of the lives we've been given.

39
03:03.800 --> 03:04.599
Aunt Lanxiang,

40
03:08.919 --> 03:11.039
will we be driven out?

41
03:13.639 --> 03:14.439
No.

42
03:23.840 --> 03:24.719
Old Master.

43
03:25.016 --> 03:26.968
- Great-Grandfather. - Great-Grandfather.

44
03:28.280 --> 03:32.599
Your eldest uncle once wanted you two to take your mother's surname.

45
03:33.319 --> 03:34.520
I refused.

46
03:35.319 --> 03:37.000
Being entered into the family genealogy

47
03:37.319 --> 03:39.319
is not a decision to be made on a whim.

48
03:40.719 --> 03:43.919
Now, are you both willing

49
03:44.360 --> 03:47.759
to give up your father's surname and take your mother's?

50
03:58.840 --> 03:59.840
- We are. - We are.

51
04:07.719 --> 04:09.120
From this day forward,

52
04:10.199 --> 04:12.400
(Lin Zhangjun) Lin Zhangjun and Lin Zhangzhi

53
04:12.800 --> 04:15.159
(Lin Zhangzhi) are descendants of the Lin family.

54
04:16.399 --> 04:20.120
As long as they commit no crimes,

55
04:21.519 --> 04:22.600
no one

56
04:24.120 --> 04:27.639
may drive them out of the Lin Residence.

57
04:33.000 --> 04:33.399
You...

58
04:35.120 --> 04:35.519
This...

59
04:39.240 --> 04:40.839
You've lost your senses!

60
04:41.519 --> 04:42.720
How could you do

61
04:42.730 --> 04:44.490
something so disgraceful and foolish? You...

62
04:44.920 --> 04:46.480
This is outrageous!

63
04:47.800 --> 04:49.279
My eldest grandson's wife,

64
04:49.720 --> 04:50.680
Xu,

65
04:51.600 --> 04:55.240
is broad-minded and noble in character,

66
04:55.839 --> 04:57.759
and worthy of great responsibility.

67
05:02.040 --> 05:03.480
From this day forward,

68
05:04.120 --> 05:05.839
the management of the Lin household

69
05:07.079 --> 05:08.800
is entrusted to you.

70
05:17.120 --> 05:20.079
You may decide how Cheng is to be dealt with.

71
05:45.079 --> 05:46.680
Zhangzhi, get up.

72
05:57.079 --> 05:59.560
Fengxian comes from a family of scholars

73
05:59.720 --> 06:01.208
and is well-versed in the classics.

74
06:01.560 --> 06:02.399
Within one year,

75
06:02.400 --> 06:04.312
you will remain in your room and copy the Diamond Sutra

76
06:04.399 --> 06:06.000
a thousand times for the First Madam.

77
06:08.279 --> 06:08.639
I...

78
06:14.020 --> 06:16.740
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Madam Qin of the Lin Family)

79
06:19.199 --> 06:21.079
For Aunt Lingxiao's sake,

80
06:21.448 --> 06:22.950
I won't punish you publicly today.

81
06:28.712 --> 06:30.190
Thank Lanxiang for showing her mercy.

82
06:30.279 --> 06:31.959
Thank Lanxiang for showing her mercy!

83
06:33.199 --> 06:34.399
If this happens again,

84
06:34.904 --> 06:37.352
I'll have no choice but to write to the Cheng family and ask

85
06:37.519 --> 06:39.279
how they raised their daughter.

86
06:43.310 --> 06:46.296
Thank you, Lanxiang, for your leniency.

87
06:47.820 --> 06:51.780
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

88
06:53.500 --> 06:57.340
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

89
06:57.700 --> 07:00.740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

90
07:01.460 --> 07:03.660
♪Though all the world may fade♪

91
07:03.660 --> 07:06.580
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

92
07:08.340 --> 07:12.580
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

93
07:15.460 --> 07:19.220
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

94
07:21.220 --> 07:25.140
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

95
07:25.780 --> 07:28.260
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

96
07:29.260 --> 07:35.140
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

97
07:35.740 --> 07:39.660
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

98
07:39.660 --> 07:42.860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

99
07:42.860 --> 07:46.860
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

100
07:46.860 --> 07:49.460
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

101
07:49.460 --> 07:53.780
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

102
07:53.780 --> 07:56.900
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

103
07:57.220 --> 08:00.820
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

104
08:00.820 --> 08:04.740
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

105
08:20.460 --> 08:24.780
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

106
08:27.380 --> 08:31.820
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

107
08:33.580 --> 08:37.340
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

108
08:37.980 --> 08:40.660
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

109
08:41.460 --> 08:47.580
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

110
08:47.580 --> 08:52.020
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

111
08:52.020 --> 08:55.020
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

112
08:55.020 --> 08:59.060
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

113
08:59.060 --> 09:03.020
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

114
09:03.660 --> 09:07.980
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

115
09:07.980 --> 09:11.100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

116
09:11.100 --> 09:14.940
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

117
09:14.940 --> 09:17.740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

118
09:17.740 --> 09:20.340
(Seven Years Later)

119
09:20.340 --> 09:21.860
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

120
09:21.860 --> 09:25.140
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

121
09:25.140 --> 09:29.020
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

122
09:29.020 --> 09:35.300
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

123
09:39.440 --> 09:41.320
Xiulai, if you're ever unsure about something,

124
09:41.559 --> 09:42.879
you can come discuss it with me.

125
09:43.759 --> 09:44.759
If I'm not around,

126
09:45.000 --> 09:48.759
there are still Suhua, Fengxian, and Qiuluo.

127
09:50.679 --> 09:52.840
Two heads are better than one.

128
09:53.480 --> 09:56.320
There's always a solution to every problem.

129
09:56.960 --> 09:57.879
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

130
09:58.559 --> 09:59.799
I'll handle whatever I can.

131
09:59.976 --> 10:02.200
If there's anything I can't or don't know how to handle,

132
10:02.376 --> 10:04.296
I'll be sure to ask all of you for help.

133
10:09.039 --> 10:10.960
Though we are one family,

134
10:11.080 --> 10:12.360
our bonds come first.

135
10:13.240 --> 10:16.600
But the nation has its laws, and every family has its rules.

136
10:17.519 --> 10:19.679
Without rules, there can be no order.

137
10:20.840 --> 10:22.200
If anyone breaks the family rules,

138
10:22.919 --> 10:24.759
I will punish them severely without exception.

139
10:26.376 --> 10:28.080
I hope you will all bear this in mind.

140
10:28.720 --> 10:31.559
A family that does good will be blessed for generations.

141
10:32.159 --> 10:35.399
A family that does evil will bring misfortune upon its descendants.

142
10:40.679 --> 10:41.600
- Yes. - Yes.

143
10:42.240 --> 10:44.088
- Yes, Madam. - Yes, Madam.

144
10:54.270 --> 10:57.688
(Lin Zhangcheng, age seven) Zhangcheng!

145
10:57.704 --> 10:59.480
(Lin Zhangrun, son of Lin Jinqi and Xu Lanxiang, age four)

146
10:59.480 --> 11:01.000
Zhangcheng, I want it.

147
11:01.279 --> 11:02.639
Come on. Come to me.

148
11:05.176 --> 11:06.200
Zhangcheng, slow down.

149
11:07.960 --> 11:09.600
Come on. Let's play with this, all right?

150
11:09.759 --> 11:11.120
Zhangcheng, slow down.

151
11:11.399 --> 11:12.000
Be careful.

152
11:12.000 --> 11:12.720
I know, Father.

153
11:13.759 --> 11:15.159
Mother cried and made such a fuss,

154
11:15.600 --> 11:17.799
saying that all her gray hair was caused by me.

155
11:19.048 --> 11:20.488
Nothing she says will change my mind.

156
11:20.670 --> 11:22.136
I've made up my mind not to marry.

157
11:23.120 --> 11:25.200
Lanxiang, won't you try to talk her around?

158
11:26.600 --> 11:28.240
Life is only a few short decades.

159
11:28.536 --> 11:31.032
What matters most is that she's happy with her own life.

160
11:36.536 --> 11:38.040
Your mother-in-law, Old Madam Yuan,

161
11:38.050 --> 11:39.160
just couldn't let things go.

162
11:39.240 --> 11:40.480
Don't be like her.

163
11:41.240 --> 11:43.480
She insisted on taking concubines just to have a grandson

164
11:43.799 --> 11:45.240
and even took two in succession.

165
11:45.832 --> 11:47.890
Both were chosen after consulting a fortune-teller.

166
11:47.960 --> 11:48.879
And what happened?

167
11:49.440 --> 11:51.399
Two more granddaughters were born in a row.

168
11:53.639 --> 11:56.159
Old Madam Yuan practically worried herself to death.

169
11:57.879 --> 12:00.840
Old Madam Yuan died after becoming gravely ill.

170
12:03.240 --> 12:03.720
Right.

171
12:04.679 --> 12:05.679
She died of illness.

172
12:06.200 --> 12:07.279
It was illness.

173
12:07.559 --> 12:08.960
Xiuwan is right.

174
12:10.039 --> 12:11.960
What is meant to be yours will come to you.

175
12:12.639 --> 12:15.240
What is not meant to be yours should not be forced.

176
12:16.904 --> 12:19.600
There's nothing wrong with staying single and carefree for life.

177
12:22.919 --> 12:23.840
Let's play with this.

178
12:25.840 --> 12:27.840
Your Lordship!

179
12:29.639 --> 12:30.320
Your Lordship!

180
12:32.720 --> 12:33.159
Baogai.

181
12:38.000 --> 12:38.679
What is it?

182
12:40.159 --> 12:40.799
His Majesty...

183
12:42.559 --> 12:45.279
His Majesty has passed away.

184
12:54.159 --> 12:56.080
Mother...

185
13:01.840 --> 13:02.879
When did it happen?

186
13:04.879 --> 13:07.559
At three quarters past the Hour of Yin, on the first of this month.

187
13:08.879 --> 13:10.039
Eighteen days ago.

188
13:12.056 --> 13:13.390
What about the Eldest Prince?

189
13:15.000 --> 13:17.080
The new Emperor has already ascended the throne.

190
13:35.639 --> 13:36.480
Head Butler,

191
13:36.799 --> 13:38.720
you and Baogai quickly send people separately

192
13:38.799 --> 13:40.540
to notify everyone else in the household.

193
13:40.559 --> 13:42.700
The entire household will observe national mourning.

194
13:42.744 --> 13:43.630
No meat is to be eaten.

195
13:43.879 --> 13:45.120
No drinking or festivities.

196
13:45.919 --> 13:46.679
Yes.

197
13:51.480 --> 13:52.200
Lanxiang,

198
13:52.559 --> 13:53.720
I must hurry back.

199
13:55.559 --> 13:55.960
All right.

200
14:04.080 --> 14:04.519
Let's go.

201
14:04.600 --> 14:06.320
I'll take you to change your clothes.

202
14:06.536 --> 14:07.960
Then we'll have some sweet cakes.

203
14:09.480 --> 14:10.000
Go on.

204
14:10.399 --> 14:11.399
All right, Mother.

205
14:35.559 --> 14:36.679
By that reckoning,

206
14:36.919 --> 14:39.759
Fengtai and I are already family.

207
14:39.760 --> 14:41.368
Your Highness, hold on a little longer.

208
14:41.370 --> 14:42.360
We're out of the city...

209
14:42.360 --> 14:44.879
I'm fine. Full speed ahead.

210
14:45.320 --> 14:47.960
The Crown Prince has returned!

211
14:51.200 --> 14:53.679
This firearm was just forged by the Imperial Armory.

212
14:53.816 --> 14:55.976
I grant you special permission to carry it with you.

213
14:57.180 --> 15:01.660
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

214
15:01.980 --> 15:06.060
♪Raindrops fall, one by one, into my dreams♪

215
15:07.660 --> 15:09.780
♪If they should wake me♪

216
15:09.780 --> 15:12.500
♪Hardship will always remain♪

217
15:12.500 --> 15:17.980
♪Amid treacherous waters, few make it to the end♪

218
15:17.980 --> 15:22.940
♪How could a thousand words soothe this aching heart?♪

219
15:22.940 --> 15:28.300
♪With guilt in my heart, how could I ask to meet again?♪

220
15:29.940 --> 15:35.020
♪May I be like a firefly awakening in the dark♪

221
15:37.112 --> 15:39.360
The late Emperor stood by you through difficult times.

222
15:40.679 --> 15:41.919
Later, let's go together

223
15:42.168 --> 15:44.328
and burn some paper offerings for the late Emperor

224
15:45.120 --> 15:46.559
as a small gesture of farewell.

225
15:46.559 --> 15:50.980
♪I'd spend every dawn and dusk to see it through♪

226
15:53.519 --> 15:57.039
I still vividly remember how we

227
15:58.600 --> 16:00.200
rode side by side and fled Jinling.

228
16:02.639 --> 16:06.440
Now we are separated by life and death,

229
16:08.200 --> 16:09.480
with only memories left.

230
16:16.240 --> 16:18.879
Though the late Emperor loved crickets,

231
16:20.759 --> 16:22.039
he still knew when to stop.

232
16:23.416 --> 16:25.000
He could be considered a worthy ruler.

233
16:26.960 --> 16:27.960
But the new Emperor...

234
16:40.000 --> 16:44.799
I'll be more careful with my words and actions from now on.

235
17:06.900 --> 17:11.100
(One Year Later)

236
17:23.100 --> 17:25.180
(For Imperial Use)

237
17:49.500 --> 17:52.360
(Commander Ding, Third-Rank, Commander of the Longjiang Garrison)

238
17:52.440 --> 17:53.280
(For Imperial Use)

239
18:04.200 --> 18:07.960
The undefeated General Blackhead

240
18:08.359 --> 18:11.759
(Attendant Eunuch Mao, Fourth-Rank) met a brutal death at the hands

241
18:11.759 --> 18:13.200
(Attendant Eunuch of the Directorate of Ceremonial)

242
18:13.200 --> 18:14.160
of river bandits.

243
18:24.519 --> 18:27.640
The river bandits' methods are brutal and bloody,

244
18:28.559 --> 18:30.240
and utterly appalling.

245
18:31.079 --> 18:33.480
This cannot be tolerated.

246
18:42.200 --> 18:45.400
This is all because the Longjiang Garrison is utterly incompetent

247
18:45.544 --> 18:47.576
and failed in its duty to provide protection.

248
18:49.128 --> 18:51.590
Eunuch Wang spared your families from collective punishment

249
18:51.944 --> 18:54.640
and granted the Longjiang Garrison special permission to raise funds

250
18:54.759 --> 18:56.880
to compensate for the plundered tribute goods.

251
18:57.279 --> 19:01.599
That is already an extraordinary act of mercy.

252
19:02.344 --> 19:03.590
(Xu Guangyi, Duke Xiangguo)

253
19:03.599 --> 19:06.359
(Jinling Defense Commander, Commander) Attendant Eunuch Mao is right.

254
19:06.360 --> 19:07.000
(of the Central Military Command)

255
19:08.799 --> 19:09.599
Now,

256
19:10.759 --> 19:13.160
Commander Ding has been killed by the river bandits,

257
19:14.640 --> 19:17.480
leaving the post of Commander of the Longjiang Garrison vacant.

258
19:20.060 --> 19:21.592
(Xu Sizi, son of Duke Xiangguo, Fourth-Rank,)

259
19:21.592 --> 19:22.860
(Assistant Commander of the Jinling Imperial Guard)

260
19:30.152 --> 19:31.752
Marquis Lin, Eunuch Wang holds

261
19:31.992 --> 19:34.720
the esteemed post of Chief Eunuch of the Directorate of Ceremonial

262
19:34.720 --> 19:36.520
and attends to countless affairs each day,

263
19:36.536 --> 19:38.550
yet he has not forgotten an old friend.

264
19:38.760 --> 19:41.352
Knowing that you have been without an official post for years,

265
19:41.400 --> 19:44.350
he personally petitioned His Majesty on your behalf

266
19:44.440 --> 19:47.720
to appoint you Commander of the Longjiang Garrison.

267
19:48.240 --> 19:50.079
You must ensure that the Longjiang Garrison

268
19:50.279 --> 19:53.599
compensates for the plundered tribute goods as soon as possible.

269
19:53.928 --> 19:56.312
I'm grateful for Eunuch Wang's confidence in me.

270
19:56.680 --> 19:58.440
I'll do everything I can

271
19:58.696 --> 20:00.792
to raise the compensation as soon as possible.

272
20:01.160 --> 20:02.400
More importantly,

273
20:02.960 --> 20:06.279
we must bring the river bandits who plundered the tribute goods

274
20:06.279 --> 20:07.640
to justice

275
20:07.880 --> 20:12.119
and avenge General Blackhead.

276
20:14.520 --> 20:17.112
I will do everything in my power to track down the killers

277
20:17.440 --> 20:18.880
and ease His Majesty's burden.

278
20:21.160 --> 20:25.440
Avenge General Blackhead.

279
20:37.880 --> 20:39.160
Attendant Eunuch Mao is right.

280
20:46.820 --> 20:49.060
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

281
20:51.240 --> 20:52.039
Your Lord.

282
20:53.720 --> 20:56.680
A Third-Rank Commander was brutally tortured and killed.

283
20:57.128 --> 20:58.960
These river bandits clearly have no regard

284
20:58.960 --> 21:00.880
for the laws of the imperial court.

285
21:00.936 --> 21:02.400
Their methods are clearly ruthless

286
21:02.400 --> 21:03.519
and far from ordinary.

287
21:04.599 --> 21:08.119
The Longjiang Garrison lacks military funds and equipment.

288
21:08.559 --> 21:10.240
Now its troops are demoralized.

289
21:10.712 --> 21:11.992
You're asking them to...

290
21:14.488 --> 21:16.360
You're asking them to bankrupt themselves

291
21:16.370 --> 21:18.030
to compensate for the tribute goods,

292
21:18.400 --> 21:20.400
and also to capture the river bandits.

293
21:20.440 --> 21:21.839
How could that possibly work?

294
21:27.680 --> 21:29.119
I'm getting old.

295
21:29.359 --> 21:31.599
My hearing isn't what it used to be.

296
21:32.400 --> 21:33.400
Not what it used to be.

297
22:07.144 --> 22:09.832
Unfortunately, I've just received orders from the Ministry of War

298
22:10.136 --> 22:12.712
to oversee Zhejiang's coastal defenses against the Wo pirates.

299
22:13.799 --> 22:16.279
I'll be leaving Jinling soon

300
22:16.360 --> 22:18.152
to take up my post on the Zhejiang coast.

301
22:19.799 --> 22:21.759
I won't be able to lend you a hand, Fengtai.

302
22:24.296 --> 22:26.520
Investigating cases is something I'm fairly good at.

303
22:27.599 --> 22:29.480
No matter how good you are at investigating,

304
22:30.079 --> 22:32.039
you still need capable men under your command.

305
22:32.359 --> 22:34.880
The compensation for the tribute goods is no small sum.

306
22:35.640 --> 22:37.720
If the soldiers are driven into ruin,

307
22:38.079 --> 22:39.799
they're bound to harbor resentment.

308
22:40.599 --> 22:42.640
Why would they still take orders from you?

309
22:45.912 --> 22:47.880
I've already submitted a memorial to His Majesty

310
22:47.992 --> 22:49.350
proposing reforms to naval service.

311
22:49.912 --> 22:52.720
The conscription system would be replaced with government-paid labor.

312
22:53.680 --> 22:57.079
All military households would share the cost according to their means.

313
22:57.920 --> 22:59.960
This way, poorer households

314
23:00.160 --> 23:02.880
wouldn't be ruined when assigned minor service duties,

315
23:03.200 --> 23:04.279
while well-off households

316
23:04.720 --> 23:06.519
could also be spared the burden of service.

317
23:07.240 --> 23:08.440
Will His Majesty approve it?

318
23:11.480 --> 23:13.110
The compensation His Majesty receives

319
23:13.200 --> 23:14.599
will be paid in full.

320
23:15.480 --> 23:17.510
It will also prevent the soldiers from mutinying.

321
23:18.472 --> 23:20.270
Even if His Majesty doesn't understand,

322
23:21.200 --> 23:22.240
the Grand Secretariat will.

323
23:22.776 --> 23:24.000
They will certainly approve it.

324
23:24.400 --> 23:25.960
The eunuchs wield great power now.

325
23:28.200 --> 23:29.160
You must be careful.

326
23:35.720 --> 23:37.912
Our coastal defenses are short of troops now.

327
23:38.599 --> 23:39.880
You be careful, too.

328
23:49.220 --> 23:54.540
(The Tale of Suppressing the Bandits)

329
24:24.860 --> 24:27.440
(The Tale of Suppressing the Bandits: The General, Tanniang)

330
24:27.440 --> 24:28.920
The Tale of Suppressing the Bandits?

331
24:30.359 --> 24:31.759
The general, Tanniang,

332
24:33.119 --> 24:34.240
is a woman?

333
24:34.680 --> 24:35.960
Do you think, Marquis Lin,

334
24:36.359 --> 24:37.920
that women cannot be generals?

335
24:39.440 --> 24:40.759
The Shang dynasty had Fu Hao.

336
24:40.960 --> 24:42.359
The Sui dynasty had Madam Xian.

337
24:42.600 --> 24:44.200
The Tang dynasty had Princess Pingyang.

338
24:44.720 --> 24:47.079
Which of them achieved any less than male generals?

339
24:51.920 --> 24:53.599
Your husband is poorly learned,

340
24:54.000 --> 24:55.640
and bound by outdated conventions.

341
24:56.160 --> 24:57.319
I spoke rashly just now.

342
24:57.799 --> 24:59.400
Please forgive me, my lady.

343
25:01.920 --> 25:03.599
Don't underestimate the play I wrote.

344
25:03.848 --> 25:05.340
Even the vendors selling wooden swords

345
25:05.359 --> 25:07.079
at the Imperial Theater

346
25:07.200 --> 25:09.192
have seen their earnings rise by thirty percent.

347
25:09.319 --> 25:10.960
Zhangcheng's future shops

348
25:11.160 --> 25:13.599
and farmland will all depend on this pen of mine.

349
25:14.136 --> 25:16.280
You really do have a knack for running the household.

350
25:16.920 --> 25:19.599
I happen to have something I'd like your advice on.

351
25:23.864 --> 25:26.240
Over the years, the stricter the maritime ban has become,

352
25:26.312 --> 25:28.152
the more rampant the bandits have grown.

353
25:28.920 --> 25:31.519
River bandits even openly attack and plunder government vessels.

354
25:32.640 --> 25:33.640
I understand

355
25:34.160 --> 25:37.000
that the late Emperor reduced the troops, leaving us short of manpower.

356
25:37.400 --> 25:38.790
But without reducing the troops,

357
25:38.840 --> 25:40.936
the Ministry of Revenue couldn't afford the expense.

358
25:43.000 --> 25:45.599
If the Ministry of Revenue had a steady stream of tax revenue,

359
25:46.039 --> 25:47.759
wouldn't it be able to support the army?

360
25:48.839 --> 25:50.039
You mean...

361
25:57.740 --> 26:00.319
(To My Dear Friend, Lv Ji'er)

362
26:00.319 --> 26:02.200
This is a letter from Ji'er.

363
26:03.000 --> 26:04.119
At my request,

364
26:04.216 --> 26:06.712
she recorded Quanzhou's local customs and people's livelihoods

365
26:06.720 --> 26:07.640
in detail.

366
26:12.060 --> 26:14.759
(Pepper: 0.24 taels per kg. Agarwood: 1.6 taels per kg.)

367
26:14.760 --> 26:16.824
These are the prices around Jinling and Suzhou

368
26:16.872 --> 26:19.440
that I collected for writing my plays.

369
26:24.420 --> 26:25.720
(Pepper: 0.24 taels per kg. Agarwood: 1.6 taels per kg.)

370
26:25.720 --> 26:27.640
The profits really are substantial.

371
26:28.839 --> 26:30.400
No wonder Jinqiao was tempted.

372
26:31.544 --> 26:33.830
How did Yu the Great succeed in controlling the floods?

373
26:34.599 --> 26:36.119
He simply followed eight words.

374
26:36.960 --> 26:40.559
Better to channel than block, better to guide than channel.

375
26:42.799 --> 26:43.440
Exactly.

376
26:44.359 --> 26:46.599
If the imperial court allowed maritime trade

377
26:47.440 --> 26:48.880
and properly regulated and guided it,

378
26:49.519 --> 26:51.279
the people could not only earn a living,

379
26:52.039 --> 26:53.000
but the government

380
26:53.128 --> 26:55.112
would also have a steady stream of tax revenue.

381
26:56.279 --> 26:57.119
Unfortunately,

382
26:57.680 --> 26:59.440
pirates and Wo pirates are rampant now.

383
27:00.039 --> 27:01.839
Even without the imperial maritime ban,

384
27:02.040 --> 27:03.750
maritime trade would still be difficult.

385
27:06.456 --> 27:09.112
Chengze has been transferred to reorganize the coastal defenses.

386
27:09.640 --> 27:12.472
It's the perfect opportunity to eliminate the pirates and Wo pirates.

387
27:13.880 --> 27:16.039
I'm now Commander of the Longjiang Garrison,

388
27:16.319 --> 27:18.279
so I can also wipe out the river bandits

389
27:18.328 --> 27:19.680
and strengthen the river defenses.

390
27:20.160 --> 27:21.960
Once peace is restored throughout the land,

391
27:22.952 --> 27:25.550
we can abolish the tribute system and lift the maritime ban.

392
27:25.880 --> 27:27.559
The cotton grown by the people

393
27:27.560 --> 27:28.790
and the cotton cloth they weave

394
27:28.920 --> 27:30.960
could then be sold overseas in a steady stream

395
27:31.240 --> 27:32.200
in exchange for silver.

396
27:32.599 --> 27:35.519
Commander of the Longjiang Garrison?

397
27:48.319 --> 27:49.920
I was appointed just today.

398
27:51.400 --> 27:52.799
I was about to tell you,

399
27:53.119 --> 27:54.519
but then I saw the play you wrote.

400
27:54.536 --> 27:56.590
It was so beautifully written and so captivating

401
27:57.119 --> 28:00.960
that I completely forgot.

402
28:08.519 --> 28:09.680
You brazen bandits!

403
28:09.759 --> 28:11.440
I'm standing right here!

404
28:11.559 --> 28:12.759
Surrender now,

405
28:12.960 --> 28:14.839
or you will be shown no mercy!

406
28:23.704 --> 28:25.110
Running around like a madwoman.

407
28:25.240 --> 28:27.080
Is that any way for a young lady to behave?

408
28:32.880 --> 28:34.599
Are you trying to anger me to death?

409
28:35.799 --> 28:38.000
General Wang, your timing is perfect!

410
28:38.119 --> 28:40.759
We'll attack them from both sides

411
28:40.960 --> 28:44.039
and wipe out the bandits in one fell swoop!

412
28:46.039 --> 28:48.200
Why don't you wipe me out while you're at it?

413
28:48.559 --> 28:50.519
Are you trying to anger me to death?

414
28:50.839 --> 28:51.720
You really...

415
28:53.240 --> 28:53.640
This...

416
28:55.839 --> 28:56.200
I...

417
28:56.480 --> 28:59.559
How did I ever raise a daughter like you?

418
29:02.359 --> 29:03.640
Mother, please don't cry.

419
29:04.776 --> 29:07.768
- You're driving me to my grave! - I'll behave like a proper young lady.

420
29:08.400 --> 29:09.799
Will that do?

421
29:12.160 --> 29:12.839
You...

422
29:12.920 --> 29:13.839
Mother.

423
29:19.279 --> 29:22.079
Old Master is getting older by the day.

424
29:22.519 --> 29:24.359
One day, he'll be gone.

425
29:25.519 --> 29:28.319
Then the first and second branches will divide the family property.

426
29:28.808 --> 29:30.790
No matter how good Jinqi and Lanxiang are to you,

427
29:31.319 --> 29:32.880
they belong to a different branch.

428
29:33.319 --> 29:35.359
You won't be able to rely on them in the future.

429
29:36.519 --> 29:37.759
I have you, Mother.

430
29:39.440 --> 29:41.319
Can I stay with you forever?

431
29:41.680 --> 29:43.519
I'll be gone sooner or later, too.

432
29:44.640 --> 29:45.519
In our branch,

433
29:46.319 --> 29:48.720
Fengxian will be in charge from then on.

434
29:49.359 --> 29:52.720
She's as petty as they come.

435
29:53.279 --> 29:54.960
If you have to depend on her,

436
29:55.480 --> 29:56.839
how could you possibly live well?

437
29:59.032 --> 30:01.110
You should find a husband and marry while you can.

438
30:05.160 --> 30:06.839
Mother has prepared a dowry for me.

439
30:07.240 --> 30:08.480
I won't need to depend on her.

440
30:11.279 --> 30:13.000
Your dowry?

441
30:13.279 --> 30:15.680
It won't be yours until you're married.

442
30:16.839 --> 30:19.160
An unmarried daughter cannot own property.

443
30:20.088 --> 30:22.350
When the time comes, not a single thing in this residence

444
30:22.359 --> 30:23.799
will belong to you.

445
30:25.440 --> 30:27.519
And you call me foolish?

446
30:29.359 --> 30:31.759
You're the foolish one!

447
30:47.400 --> 30:48.680
I'll find a way

448
30:49.079 --> 30:50.400
to earn enough to support myself.

449
30:52.839 --> 30:55.920
What can a woman like you possibly do?

450
31:02.720 --> 31:03.720
Be a good girl

451
31:04.160 --> 31:06.960
and marry Second Master You as his second wife.

452
31:07.960 --> 31:08.920
Then at least

453
31:10.359 --> 31:12.039
you'll have someone to rely on.

454
31:12.380 --> 31:16.180
♪Yet I must still smile through it all♪

455
31:16.180 --> 31:18.740
♪Those things I can't forget♪

456
31:18.740 --> 31:22.820
♪The absurdities I can't let go of fill every page♪

457
31:23.060 --> 31:24.860
♪Building a wall♪

458
31:24.860 --> 31:28.540
♪Trapped in the midst of time♪

459
31:28.540 --> 31:32.460
♪Drifting with the wind♪

460
31:32.940 --> 31:36.540
(Jinling Lin Family Zezhi Workshop)

461
31:36.540 --> 31:37.940
(Zezhi Workshop)

462
31:39.064 --> 31:40.792
What are you looking at? Get moving.

463
31:42.140 --> 31:45.980
(Zezhi Workshop)

464
32:05.336 --> 32:07.400
Our Zezhi Workshop's looms and weaving techniques

465
32:07.464 --> 32:09.128
are the most advanced available today.

466
32:09.512 --> 32:11.800
I've taken care of everything over there. Don't worry.

467
32:13.839 --> 32:15.119
This is our Xiaobu cloth,

468
32:15.599 --> 32:16.880
priced at 2 coins per bolt.

469
32:17.240 --> 32:19.519
Feihua cloth is 6 coins per bolt.

470
32:19.576 --> 32:20.790
As for waist-loom ramie cloth,

471
32:20.920 --> 32:22.759
it's 3.5 coins per bolt.

472
32:24.184 --> 32:26.240
Now take a look at our coarse white cotton cloth.

473
32:26.519 --> 32:28.559
It's 0.94 coin for three meters.

474
32:28.808 --> 32:31.110
Fine three-shuttle cloth is 0.9 coin for three meters.

475
32:31.400 --> 32:34.160
Fine blue cotton cloth is 1.05 coins for three meters.

476
32:35.640 --> 32:37.279
If I place a larger order,

477
32:38.039 --> 32:40.440
could you offer me a better price, Shopkeeper Zhou?

478
32:41.799 --> 32:44.079
Of course we offer discounts to major customers.

479
32:45.940 --> 32:48.140
(Gu Youzi, Lady Peng)

480
33:00.312 --> 33:01.496
Second Young Lady.

481
33:02.400 --> 33:03.480
Lady Peng, what is it?

482
33:03.880 --> 33:06.319
The Head Shopkeeper arranged to inspect the latest waist looms

483
33:06.319 --> 33:07.440
at Han Family Village outside the city today.

484
33:07.440 --> 33:09.144
If we don't leave now, we'll be late.

485
33:09.440 --> 33:12.119
The latest single-heddle, double-treadle twill loom?

486
33:12.640 --> 33:13.039
Yes.

487
33:13.192 --> 33:14.390
That's right, Shopkeeper Zhou.

488
33:14.480 --> 33:17.119
How much can you produce here in a day?

489
33:17.519 --> 33:18.799
Shopkeeper Zhou is busy.

490
33:18.920 --> 33:19.839
I'll go with you.

491
33:19.920 --> 33:20.400
All right.

492
33:37.480 --> 33:38.680
There'll be no one on the road.

493
33:38.920 --> 33:40.160
You can get some fresh air, too.

494
33:41.752 --> 33:44.136
I'm sorry to put you through this, Second Young Lady.

495
33:45.440 --> 33:46.599
With the new looms,

496
33:46.880 --> 33:48.400
a skilled weaver like you

497
33:48.480 --> 33:50.279
can weave one extra bolt every three days.

498
33:50.279 --> 33:51.359
That's all money.

499
33:52.780 --> 33:55.112
If a little inconvenience is all it takes to make money,

500
33:55.120 --> 33:56.430
I could make this trip every day.

501
33:56.440 --> 33:57.440
Even ten times a day.

502
34:54.952 --> 34:55.760
It's all my fault.

503
34:55.920 --> 34:56.840
This is all my fault.

504
34:57.016 --> 34:59.030
I was busy discussing business with the merchants

505
34:59.096 --> 35:01.100
and let the Second Young Lady go outside the city to inspect the looms.

506
35:01.110 --> 35:02.440
This has nothing to do with you.

507
35:02.728 --> 35:04.504
You couldn't have known this would happen.

508
35:04.552 --> 35:07.150
How could it have nothing to do with her?

509
35:08.420 --> 35:09.340
Your Lordship.

510
35:09.340 --> 35:12.540
(Lin Jincen, age 22. Gan Qiuluo, Lin Jincen's wife)

511
35:16.519 --> 35:17.400
Any news?

512
35:18.264 --> 35:19.760
We've searched throughout the city.

513
35:22.568 --> 35:23.940
The city gates are already closed.

514
35:23.992 --> 35:27.064
I'll continue searching outside the city first thing tomorrow morning.

515
35:28.639 --> 35:29.159
Mother.

516
35:35.360 --> 35:36.159
Second Madam.

517
35:37.440 --> 35:40.320
If anything at all happens to Xiuwan,

518
35:40.840 --> 35:42.559
I'll skin you alive!

519
35:42.960 --> 35:44.760
- Aunt Lingxiao! - Aunt Lingxiao!

520
35:45.440 --> 35:46.199
Aunt Lingxiao!

521
35:47.920 --> 35:48.679
Aunt Lingxiao!

522
35:48.920 --> 35:50.320
It's not Gantang's fault.

523
35:50.904 --> 35:51.920
It's all because of you!

524
35:51.920 --> 35:52.960
Mother!

525
35:53.480 --> 35:55.239
You have no sense of propriety at all!

526
35:56.480 --> 35:58.920
It's not Madam's fault. It's all my fault.

527
35:59.199 --> 36:01.599
You kept taking Xiuwan to hear those outrageous

528
36:01.599 --> 36:03.039
and indecent plays.

529
36:03.528 --> 36:05.630
Not only did they fill her head with improper ideas,

530
36:05.640 --> 36:08.200
but they also made her think all day about earning her own money

531
36:08.264 --> 36:09.440
and refusing to marry!

532
36:09.880 --> 36:10.760
Aunt Lingxiao!

533
36:15.224 --> 36:16.360
Xiuwan has gone missing.

534
36:16.360 --> 36:17.599
We're all very worried.

535
36:18.264 --> 36:19.590
But she's already thirty-five.

536
36:19.710 --> 36:21.080
She's not a three-year-old child!

537
36:21.320 --> 36:22.840
What she should or shouldn't do

538
36:22.850 --> 36:24.510
is beyond even your control as her mother.

539
36:24.800 --> 36:26.639
How can you blame your niece-in-law for this?

540
36:32.719 --> 36:33.039
You...

541
36:39.199 --> 36:43.280
Tomorrow, Jincen and Liu Xiaochuan will continue searching the city.

542
36:43.448 --> 36:45.544
Jinqiao and I will search outside the city.

543
36:45.848 --> 36:47.992
We'll make sure we give you an answer, Aunt Lingxiao.

544
36:48.599 --> 36:49.280
All right.

545
37:00.119 --> 37:02.119
My Xiuwan...

546
37:06.679 --> 37:07.719
Our ancestors taught us

547
37:07.832 --> 37:09.400
that women should be chaste and modest

548
37:09.480 --> 37:11.150
and should not show themselves in public.

549
37:11.199 --> 37:14.079
Xiuwan followed Lanxiang and forgot our ancestors' teachings.

550
37:14.216 --> 37:15.630
That's why this happened to her.

551
37:17.800 --> 37:19.800
It's all because of that servant Xu.

552
37:20.200 --> 37:21.550
She's reckless and presumptuous,

553
37:21.559 --> 37:22.679
with no regard for the rules!

554
37:22.910 --> 37:25.430
Mother, Fengxian, you're both shouting at the top of your lungs.

555
37:25.440 --> 37:27.144
Do you want every servant to hear you?

556
37:42.280 --> 37:43.599
Mother has never had much sense.

557
37:43.704 --> 37:45.320
Lanxiang, please don't take it to heart.

558
37:50.960 --> 37:52.079
We'll be going now.

559
37:53.000 --> 37:54.039
Jinqi, Lanxiang.

560
37:54.760 --> 37:55.880
Get some rest.

561
38:08.639 --> 38:09.920
We'll search together tomorrow.

562
38:14.480 --> 38:15.000
Baogai.

563
38:29.239 --> 38:30.920
Xiuwan picked up the loom

564
38:31.070 --> 38:33.048
and went missing on her way back to the city.

565
38:33.272 --> 38:34.470
First thing tomorrow morning,

566
38:34.480 --> 38:36.400
Gantang and I will go back to the workshop

567
38:36.679 --> 38:38.519
and ask the women who know Lady Peng

568
38:38.800 --> 38:40.320
to see if there are any other clues.

569
38:42.719 --> 38:45.239
You were put through a lot today.

570
38:47.599 --> 38:49.320
As long as Xiuwan comes back safely,

571
38:50.360 --> 38:51.599
I'll ask for nothing more.

572
40:49.960 --> 40:50.840
What's that sound?

573
40:51.128 --> 40:52.184
Let's go take a look.

574
41:17.400 --> 41:19.960
Come on! Hurry!

575
41:28.159 --> 41:29.199
It's not a rabbit.

576
41:29.199 --> 41:30.719
Then it must be a badger.

577
41:44.239 --> 41:45.119
They escaped!

578
41:45.639 --> 41:47.199
The weavers we abducted escaped!

579
41:47.280 --> 41:48.119
Someone come!

580
41:48.119 --> 41:49.039
The weavers we abducted escaped!

581
41:49.039 --> 41:49.599
Someone come!

582
41:49.599 --> 41:50.119
Where is everyone?

583
41:50.119 --> 41:50.719
Get out here!

584
41:50.719 --> 41:51.239
Hurry!

585
41:51.239 --> 41:51.960
Search everywhere!

586
41:52.199 --> 41:52.679
Search!

587
41:56.079 --> 41:56.719
Come out!

588
41:56.719 --> 41:59.039
Fire!

589
41:59.920 --> 42:00.639
Fire!

590
42:07.700 --> 42:11.020
(Zhang Shuizai, Leader of the Kidnappers)

591
42:17.199 --> 42:18.679
Get water and put out the fire.

592
42:18.719 --> 42:20.119
- Yes! - Yes! Hurry!

593
42:33.320 --> 42:36.039
This isn't a safe place to linger.

594
42:55.020 --> 42:56.820
(Construction Supervisor, Ministry of Works)

595
43:05.060 --> 43:07.460
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

596
43:15.380 --> 43:22.039
(Wanted)

597
43:22.039 --> 43:23.840
Lin Jinqi.

598
43:24.320 --> 43:26.119
Xu Lanxiang.

599
43:28.400 --> 43:30.000
It's been sixteen years.

600
43:33.000 --> 43:34.000
You don't even

601
43:35.639 --> 43:37.159
recognize me anymore?

602
43:55.780 --> 43:59.900
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

603
44:02.740 --> 44:07.260
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

604
44:08.540 --> 44:12.460
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

605
44:13.140 --> 44:15.900
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

606
44:16.620 --> 44:18.940
♪Though all the world may fade♪

607
44:18.940 --> 44:22.020
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

608
44:23.540 --> 44:27.780
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

609
44:30.700 --> 44:34.860
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

610
44:36.660 --> 44:40.220
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

611
44:40.220 --> 44:43.780
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

612
44:44.580 --> 44:50.260
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

613
44:50.620 --> 44:54.940
